  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut milk, lime juice, olive oil, garlic, ginger, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the skirt steak pieces to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread the marinated steak pieces onto skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked to desired level of doneness.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro, if desired."
